  "notes": "Reverified 2026-09-14 for HT-013. The current First-Year Students page says a student completing a Florida public A.A. and high-school diploma at the same time may apply through a specific first-year no-score pathway, with an official college transcript and enrollment conditions. The separate Applying with a Florida Public AA page says the same-time-A.A. first-year route requires SAT/ACT scores while the transfer route may request a waiver. Preserve this official-source conflict, distinguish ordinary first-year applicants from the special pathway, and route application-route questions to Admissions."
